omer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=iZm0QLeg0LEQ7kNvwEaTXu0&_nc_oc=AdrvW2FAwFIuuxr6LnE--csXUOBWb-Hm9zfqD1s6f1xadexrZLrLIC9bKlTokjcUfLg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBwST9Gl3k9fwo04B3pb-VbSiB-j7d2qlprg_p7WBqWCw&oe=6A649C74"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gT1mfUa4MCsQ7kNvwE8YYPz&_nc_oc=AdpE2t5qTIOZkwFW80PjhDJ8nZJp8-7a1CRaiVX58PfY5FhQafy4a1gHh6RMB3IU1qw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBtXO7Moocim11c_ILNrKhwDVqQGRYgcr8HKoua-QlMOw&oe=6A649DD6"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ltjTsc0cgbcQ7kNvwE1fz8I&_nc_oc=AdpThm5s11yVVhHvP_xUr_IYrK_KoZAbHuEVQWIsOs3m87uXdaf_6PYk8gHc6g4pz9o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDbbhrExTZnwU58oqNR21Hbys2IiMLViKF6eAksA_FeMw&oe=6A64B2F7"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://